[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ……しつこい……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch... so persistent...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "１位はこの天才のものよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First place belongs to this genius!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュ選手とヨハナ選手、ゴールを目前にして\n激しいデッドヒート！\u3000勝つのはどっちだー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje and Johanna are neck and neck as they approach the finish line! Who's gonna win?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "解説のララ様、どちらが勝つと思いますか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Commentator Queen Lara, who do you think will be victorious?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナの機体にはまだ使われていない機能があるはず。\nそれを使われたらアンチュは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna's machine still has untapped functions. If she uses those, Antje will be..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "捉えた！\u3000てーいっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got you! Take this!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おい、まずいぞ！\nあいつぶっ放してきやがった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, this is bad! She's firing at us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルアッカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Scarlet"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かってる、なんとかしないと……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know, I have to do something...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんで、こんなことになっちゃったの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why did things turn out like this?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アオナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Azure"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とにかく、今はアレをよけないと……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Either way, I need to dodge that right now...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アレデ、跳躍シタラ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What If We Jump With That?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェーロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hielo"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うんっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュ選手、上手い！\n空中に逃げて攻撃をかわした！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nice move, Antje! She escaped into the air and dodged the attack!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "チッ！\u3000なんでこんな所に台があんのよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch! Why is there a platform in a place like this?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は、この大会で優勝して……天才ぶりを\n世の中に認めさせてやるんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm going to win this competition and... make the world recognize my genius!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すごいやる気……ヨハナ、本当に勝ちたいんだ。\nそれに比べて僕たちは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Such determination... Johanna really wants to win. Compared to her, we're..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ムラサキ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Violet"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "別ニ１位\u3000ナラナクテモイイ……\nクリセルダニ頼マレタダケ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We Don't Really Need To Be First... We Were Just Asked By Criselda..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェーロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hielo"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも……でもよ、認めさせるってんなら\nこっちだって同じだろ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But... but hey, if we're talking about getting recognized, we're the same!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルアッカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Scarlet"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……１位を取って見返して……\nクリセルダにもっとほめてもらう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... I'll take first place and show them... and get even more praise from Criselda!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はああ！？\u3000なによあれ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What the heck?! What is that?!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああっと！？\u3000レースの最後に障害が待っていた！\nビィーーッグなぷにの波だー！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh no?! An obstacle awaits at the end of the race! It's a MAJORLY big wave of punis!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、アンチュ選手とヨハナ選手、\nぷにの群れにどう立ち向かうのでしょうか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, how will Antje and Johanna face this swarm of punis?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]